{
 "id": "FeelPain4",
 "slug": "feel-pain-4",
 "topic": "What if you could feel everyone's pain?",
 "part": "Chapter 4 of 4: the job only you can do, the ending (~2 min)",
 "title": [
  "WHAT IF YOU COULD",
  "FEEL EVERYONE'S PAIN?"
 ],
 "accent": "PAIN",
 "previous_text": "\"Do that again.\"",
 "script": [
  {
   "beat": "4.1",
   "text": "Three months later, you're standing in a hospital emergency room."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.2",
   "text": "Yeah. The one place you swore you'd never go."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.3",
   "text": "But here's what the doctor figured out. A lot of patients can't tell you where it hurts. Babies. People who don't speak English. People who are too scared, or too confused, or just too tough to say anything."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.4",
   "text": "You can't read their minds. But you can see them. And when you see them... you know."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.5",
   "text": "A toddler won't stop crying. Nobody can find anything wrong. You look at him for two seconds... and your left ear is throbbing. Ear infection."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.6",
   "text": "An old man swears he's \"fine, just tired.\" Your chest goes tight. The doctors run a test. He's having a heart attack. They catch it in time."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.7",
   "text": "By the end of the shift, you can barely stand. You feel like you ran a marathon, broke your arm, and had three toothaches. Because, kind of, you did."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.8",
   "text": "But for the first time since this started, it doesn't feel like a curse."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.9",
   "text": "It feels like a job. A job only you can do."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.10",
   "text": "You walk out into the parking lot. The sun is coming up. Your whole body hurts... and you're smiling."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.11",
   "text": "You get home. Your roommate shuffles into the kitchen, half asleep... and slams his toe into the table leg. Again."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.12",
   "text": "Ouch."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.13",
   "text": "Your toe is on fire. And for the first time since all this started... you laugh."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.14",
   "text": "He looks at you like you're crazy. You just grab two bags of frozen peas. One for him. One for you."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.15",
   "text": "Because maybe that's the whole point. When you feel everyone's pain... nobody has to hurt alone."
  },
  {
   "beat": "4.16",
   "text": "So, would you want this power? Or would it be too much? Tell me in the comments."
  }
 ],
